== port machine --help excerpt ==
Launch and inspect Port-managed machines

Usage: port machine [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  launch   Launch a named machine from the model
  list     List Port-managed machines under a runtime root
  status   Inspect the runtime status of a named machine
  monitor  Inspect runtime ownership, logs, and detached forward state for a named machine
  top      Inspect hypervisor and detached-forward processes for a named machine
  stop     Stop a Port-managed machine under a runtime root
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Load a Port model from a TOML file instead of using the built-in sample
  -h, --help           Print help

